name hyphen-dutch
category TLCore
revision 73410
catalogue nehyph
shortdesc Dutch hyphenation patterns.
longdesc Hyphenation patterns for Dutch in T1/EC and UTF-8 encodings.
longdesc These patterns don't handle cases like 'menuutje' > 'menu-tje',
longdesc and don't hyphenate words that have different hyphenations
longdesc according to their meaning.
depend hyph-utf8
depend hyphen-base
execute AddHyphen 	name=dutch 	lefthyphenmin=2 	righthyphenmin=2 	file=loadhyph-nl.tex 	file_patterns=hyph-nl.pat.txt 	file_exceptions=hyph-nl.hyp.txt
containersize 37996
containerchecksum ab5f3962545eee59868b208549ebeb292a9c1ff6bd891b78db034e70e22f8fb110d7bbaca1a661eaa900ef2471d7b522ea5994b20bb1fe4745df3f8d3c0af030
runfiles size=66
 texmf-dist/tex/generic/hyph-utf8/loadhyph/loadhyph-nl.tex
 texmf-dist/tex/generic/hyph-utf8/patterns/ptex/hyph-nl.ec.tex
 texmf-dist/tex/generic/hyph-utf8/patterns/tex/hyph-nl.tex
 texmf-dist/tex/generic/hyph-utf8/patterns/txt/hyph-nl.hyp.txt
 texmf-dist/tex/generic/hyph-utf8/patterns/txt/hyph-nl.pat.txt
catalogue-ctan /language/hyphenation/nehyph.tex
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics hyphenation dutch
catalogue-version 1.1
